.TH TAM-NUT 1
.SH NAME
tam-nut \- welcome and inspect a Tamlinux rootstock
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tam-nut
.RI [ welcome | inspect ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B welcome
shows the bootstrap instructions.
.B inspect
reports basic hardware information without serial numbers or filesystem IDs.
.PP
The Arch tam nut provides
.BR tam-bundle (1),
the trusted Arch systemd profile, a boot recovery service and the
.B hi
and
.B start
console entry points.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tam-bundle (1)
